  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "玩樂音樂的魔法元素",
    "sub_ename": "THE MAGICAL ELEMENT OF PLAY MUSIC",
    "describe_ch": "陽光、空氣、水，是人類賴以生存的三大元素。音樂是在整個生命中最偉大的奧秘。\r\n本課程從聲音的源起變化開始，探索音樂、樂器的奧秘。用淺顯的方式將各種音樂元素(樂理)等講授分析讓同學們瞭解各種不同樂器、音樂風格、音樂元素的特點，讓同了解好聽/耐聽的音樂是具有那些特點，又有哪些音樂是好聽 卻又不耐聽。之後讓同學分析自己喜歡的音樂、或帶自己喜歡的音樂來課程、同學們彼此可以針對所學進行分析，最後更進一步的讓同學嘗試組合創作自己的音樂。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "Sunlight, air, and water are the three major elements that humans depend on for survival. Music is the greatest mystery in the entire life. This course begins with changes in the origin of sound, exploring the mysteries of music and instruments. Use a simple way to teach and analyze various musical elements (musical theory) so that students can understand the characteristics of various instruments, musical styles, and musical elements, and let the same understand the characteristics of good/hard-to-listen music, and which music is good But he was impatient to listen. After that, let the students analyze their favorite music, or bring their favorite music to the course, the students can analyze each other according to what they have learned, and finally let the students try to combine and create their own music",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
